   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h3> »3dCheck« </h3> <h1> Captures, digitizes and analyzes complex tools </h1>",
   "body": "<p><strong>ZOLLER »3dCheck« is the perfect inspection machine for fast and process-oriented 3D digitizing.</strong></p> <p>It opens up new dimensions in the measurement of tools and is also universal, accurate and user-friendly. The ZOLLER »3dCheck« combines the advantages of the optical ZOLLER »Z3dCam« (3DSensor) with high-precision CNC axes and fully automatic transmitted light image processing.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/in/company/contact-us\">Inquire now</a></p>",
